{
  "_comment_rewrites": "3030.ripmaster3030studios.com serves the reading at its own root. ⛔ A REWRITE, NEVER A REDIRECT — a redirect would bounce the visitor to the apex and the subdomain would vanish from the address bar, which is the whole point of having it. ⚠ ONLY '/' is rewritten: the page fetches data/substrate.json, mobile.css and favicon.svg relatively, so rewriting everything would break every asset on the subdomain. ⚠ It cannot loop, because the destination '/substrate.html' is not '/' and so never re-matches. ⚠ THIS FILE TOOK THE SITE DARK ONCE (docs/DNS-AND-DOMAIN.md §4½): apex↔www belongs to the platform and nothing else, and a host-scoped rule aimed at a live host is a 50-hop loop. npm run test:name runs every redirect's host regex against the live host list — now including this subdomain — and fails if any matches.",
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/",
      "has": [
        {
          "type": "host",
          "value": "3030\\.ripmaster3030studios\\.com"
        }
      ],
      "destination": "/substrate.html"
    }
  ],
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/:path*",
      "has": [
        {
          "type": "host",
          "value": "(www\\.)?upperdeckripmaster3030\\.com"
        }
      ],
      "destination": "https://ripmaster3030studios.com/:path*",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/cards/:id((?:[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[0-3]))",
      "destination": "/cards/hero/:id.html",
      "permanent": false
    },
    {
      "source": "/cards/:id((?:3[4-9]|[4-9][0-9]|100))",
      "destination": "/cards/",
      "permanent": false
    }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
          "value": "*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/cards/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=604800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/models/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=604800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).html",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).js",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).css",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*).json",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
